{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","强袭猎矛"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","돌파의 창"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始后选定狩猎对象。主动使用时，投出狩猎之矛并引爆目标身上的裂伤。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","전투 시작 후 사냥 대상을 지정한다.\n액티브: 사냥의 창을 던져 목표에게 걸린 열상을 폭발시킨다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始4秒后，那非选定当前累计承受伤害最高的敌人作为他的“狩猎对象”，并会优先选取“狩猎对象”作为其技能目标。\n主动释放时，那非向狩猎神祈祷，投出一根必定暴击的狩猎之矛，对目标造成600% + 70% ATK的真实伤害，并在短暂延迟后引爆目标身上的裂伤，每层裂伤额外造成35% + 3.5% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 시작 4초 후, 나페이가 현재 누적 대미지를 가장 많이 받은 적군을 사냥 대상으로 삼아, 스킬 사용 시 해당 목표를 우선적으로 공격한다.\n액티브: 나페이가 사냥의 신에게 기도를 올려, 반드시 치명타가 발동하는 사냥의 창을 던져 목표에게 600% + 70% ATK의 고정 대미지를 입힌 뒤, 잠시 후 목표의 열상을 폭발시켜 열상 스택당 35% + 3.5% ATK의 추가 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":95,"end":101,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":139,"end":146,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":139,"end":145,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":193,"end":200,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":105,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":136,"end":150,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":135,"end":149,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":190,"end":204,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至630% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","사냥의 창 대미지가 630% + 70% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至660% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","사냥의 창 대미지가 660% + 70% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至690% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","사냥의 창 대미지가 690% + 70% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","狩猎之矛伤害提升至720% + 70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","사냥의 창 대미지가 720% + 70% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","猛利贯伤"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","맹렬한 관통"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","投矛暴击时对目标叠加裂伤，并在目标释放大招时引爆。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","던진 창이 치명타 대미지를 입힐 시, 목표에게 열상을 중첩하고 목표가 궁극기를 시전하면 폭발한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当那非通过普通攻击或技能投掷长矛造成暴击时，额外造成目标6.5% + 0.8%初始最大生命值的伤害（最高不超过180% + 20% ATK），并削减等量最大生命值（首领模式下，不会削减最大生命值，但会将上述伤害转为真实伤害），最多削减40%，同时使目标获得5层裂伤，最多叠加30层，该效果不可被驱散。\n当带有裂伤的敌人释放终极技能时，每层裂伤使其受到35% + 3.5% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","나페이가 일반 공격이나 창을 던져 치명타 대미지를 입힐 시, 추가로 목표 초기 최대 HP 6.5% + 0.8%의 대미지를 입히고(최대 180% + 20% ATK를 초과하지 않음) 같은 수치의 최대 HP를 감소시킨다(최대 40%, 보스 모드에서는 최대 HP가 감소하지 않으며 고정 대미지로 전환). 또한 목표가 열상 5스택을 획득한다(최대 30스택 중첩 가능, 제거 불가).\n열상을 보유한 적군은 궁극기 시전 시, 열상 스택당 35% + 3.5% ATK의 대미지를 받는다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":60,"end":66,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":179,"end":186,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":54,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":79,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":241,"end":248,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":176,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":75,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":238,"end":252,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成最大生命值伤害提升至7% + 0.8%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 목표 최대 HP의 7% + 0.8%로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":21,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成最大生命值伤害提升至7.5% + 0.8%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 목표 최대 HP의 7.5% + 0.8%로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成最大生命值伤害提升至8% + 0.8%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 목표 최대 HP의 8% + 0.8%로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":21,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","眩晕厉矛"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","기절의 창"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对累计治疗量的敌人投出长矛，造成伤害和晕眩，并使其治愈降低。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","누적 치료량이 가장 높은 적군에게 창을 던져 대미지를 입히고 스턴시키는 동시에, 치료를 감소시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对累计治疗量最高的敌人投掷长矛，造成300% + 40% ATK伤害并使其晕眩3秒，同时降低其90点治愈，持续15秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","누적 치료량이 가장 높은 적군에게 창을 던져 300% + 40% ATK의 대미지를 입히고 3초 동안 스턴시키는 동시에, 15초 동안 해당 목표의 치료를 90 감소시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至330% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 330% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 360% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至390% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 390% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升自身暴击，叠加裂伤可进一步增加暴击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 치명타가 증가한다. 열상 중첩 시 치명타가 더욱 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提高24点，自身累计对敌方叠加15层裂伤后，额外提升12点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중 자신의 치명타가 24 증가한다. 자신이 적군에게 열상 15스택을 누적시킨 후, 치명타가 추가로 12 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提高30点，自身累计对敌方叠加15层裂伤后，额外提升15点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중 자신의 치명타가 30 증가한다. 자신이 적군에게 열상 15스택을 누적시킨 후, 치명타가 추가로 15 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击提高36点，自身累计对敌方叠加15层裂伤后，额外提升18点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중 자신의 치명타가 36 증가한다. 자신이 적군에게 열상 15스택을 누적시킨 후, 치명타가 추가로 18 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","索敌碎击"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","추적 강타"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","友方角色对狩猎对象造成伤害时也会叠加裂伤。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","아군 영웅이 사냥 대상에게 대미지를 입히면 열상이 중첩된다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","那非的“狩猎对象”抗暴击降低16点，并且当其他友方角色对“狩猎对象”造成暴击时，也会对其叠加1层裂伤，每名友军每秒最多通过此种方式叠加1层。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","나페이의 사냥 대상의 치명타 저항이 16 감소한다. 다른 아군 영웅이 사냥 대상에게 치명타를 입히면 열상이 1스택 중첩되며, 각 아군마다 초당 해당 방식으로 최대 열상을 1스택 중첩할 수 있다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“狩猎对象”的抗暴击降低24点。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","사냥 대상의 치명타 저항이 24 감소한다."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“狩猎对象”身上的裂伤不低于15层时，受愈降低50点，受到伤害增加12%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","사냥 대상의 열상이 15스택 이상일 경우, 활력이 50 감소하고 받는 대미지가 12% 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“狩猎对象”的抗暴击降低32点。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","사냥 대상의 치명타 저항이 32 감소한다."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","造成暴击时，提升此次伤害的暴击增幅。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","치명타 대미지를 입힐 시, 해당 대미지의 치명타 증폭을 증가시킨다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当那非造成暴击伤害时，自身每1%的暴击率会使本次伤害额外提高0.8点暴击增幅。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","나페이가 치명타 대미지를 입힐 시, 자신의 치명타율 1%마다 해당 대미지의 치명타 증폭을 추가로 0.8 증가시킨다. "],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","追踪投矛"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","추적의 창"]]}